Error [jet.FunctionValueNotNever]: Function value does not satisfy `fn() Never`.
  --> Tests/UI/never_return_fn_value.jet:7:38
    |
  7 | run: fn() { holder: Holder{callback: returns} }
    |                                      ^^^^^^^
 Why: `fn() Never` promises the callable never completes, so a returning function has the wrong contract.
 Fix: Pass a function declared `Never`, or change the expected function type.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2426
